--- Start: nar1_00.txt Section 1 ---","speaker":""}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-269\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-269\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-269"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"■　１９９６年　春　濑津美　■","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-307\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-307\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-307"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「『…从小时候起，我的身体就很虚弱…』」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-346\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-350\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-346"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但是，我也拥有和其他孩子一样的小学时代，\n那时到了暑假，我也会在外边一直玩耍到皮肤被晒黑。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-3fb\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-401\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-3fb"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"６月…在我刚刚进入初中的那年。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-430\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-434\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-430"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"\n在我满怀兴致地订购了体育课泳装的第二天。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-480\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-477\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-480"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那一天，我头一次尝到了住院的滋味。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-4b9\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-4b2\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4b9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那是第一学期期中考试之前，\n梅雨降临不久后的一个寒冷刺骨的日子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-567\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-564\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-567"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"下着梅雨的苍白天空。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-592\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-58f\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-592"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当然，在最初的日子里，\n班里的同学们几乎每天都会来探望我。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-5f2\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-5fd\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5f2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"出院的时候，\n她们也会利用周末到我家里来玩。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-644\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-659\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-644"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…但是，这一切都只发生在最初的日子里而已。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-6b0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-6b7\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-6b0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"秋去冬来，四季流转，\n住院，出院，检查…之后再次住院。我的生活也在单调地轮回着…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-726\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-71f\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-726"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那些曾经被我当作「朋友」的同学们。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-75f\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-75c\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-75f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在不知不觉中，慢慢地变成了「熟人」。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-79a\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-793\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-79a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"最终，渐渐地，成为了「陌生人」。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-7d1\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-7c4\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7d1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"随着岁月的流逝，我的身影也在她们的记忆之中逐渐变淡…\n最终消失无痕。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-88f\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-87a\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-88f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…看来，她们似乎『不喜欢』我」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-900\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-8f3\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-900"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「对普通人来说，我的存在只是一个累赘」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-98b\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-98c\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-98b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「所以…才会被人们从记忆中抹去…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-a4c\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-a4b\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a4c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「在这个只看得到自己的世界里…\n　我送走了不知多少个季节…多少次下着梅雨的苍白天空…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-aec\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-ae1\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-aec"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「我的英语教科书，\n　自从１年级的期中考试以后，就再也没被翻开过」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-bab\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-baa\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-bab"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…从那时起…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-c0d\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-bf9\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c0d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我的时间就静止了」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-d29\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-d21\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d29"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"■　８年后…２００４年　主人公　初夏　■","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-d91\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-d89\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d91"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"夏日炎炎，灼烤着满头的汗水。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-dc4\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-dae\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-dc4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"驾照考场的一隅，放置着一块巨大的电子公告板。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-e07\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-df3\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e07"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"屏幕上的小灯泡依次亮了起来。\n我和在场的所有人一样，抬头寻找着自己的考号。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-e82\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-e76\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e82"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「２３７、２３７…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-ead\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-ea1\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-ead"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在令人眼花缭乱的文字中，\n我终于发现了自己的号码。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-f3f\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-f59\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f3f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"咣当、咣当，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-f62\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-f7e\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f62"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"中午时分，正是其他人忙碌的时候…\n太阳升起和落下时都会拥挤不堪的列车，此时则显得冷冷清清。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-fe2\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-fbf\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-fe2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我坐在这空旷的车厢一角，\n任由它带着我往家的方向驶去。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-103e\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1021\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-103e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"左手握着刚刚收到的交规课本，\n胸前的口袋里揣着崭新的驾照。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-10a9\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1092\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-10a9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「我现在也算是有驾照的人了…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-10de\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-10c5\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-10de"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"一本正经地感慨了一下，心中对此却没有丝毫现实感。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1125\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1100\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1125"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我不是很想要开车。\n也并非有着什么其他的目的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1179\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-116c\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1179"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"只是因为周围有很多人都去了驾校，\n而且他们经常劝说我也去考一张驾照。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1215\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-121e\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1215"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这一天夜里。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1238\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-123d\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1238"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我将获得驾照的事情告诉了父母。\n『是吗』，回应是如此地简短。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-129a\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-12a3\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-129a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我试着问道，能否借用父亲的车子。\n『不行』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-12e0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-12f7\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-12e0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我得到的是一句同样简短的答复。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1315\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1326\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1315"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"其实我并不想开车。\n而他们的答复也和我的预想完全一致。这就是我的父母。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-13a3\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-13c6\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-13a3"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"第二天。\n醒来后，我觉得胸口很难受。于是就去了医院。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-13fd\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1422\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-13fd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我平时很少生病。\n所以候诊的时间让我感到百无聊赖。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1481\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-14d4\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1481"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"好不容易盼到诊察结束，\n却又被送去做了透视检查和血液检查。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-14e1\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-154c\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-14e1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"之后，又被撂在了候诊室里，\n无所事事地等待了很长很长的时间…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1543\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-158b\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1543"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不知不觉间读完了候诊室中摆放着的３本漫画杂志，\n正当我将手伸向第４本的时候…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-15b5\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-15f7\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-15b5"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"医生出现了…他命令我办理了住院手续。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-15f0\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1630\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-15f0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我摸了摸口袋中那张崭新的驾照。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1625\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-167b\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1625"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"看来暂时不会有使用到它的机会了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-16db\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-172f\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-16db"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"■　主人公　２００４年　秋　■","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1751\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-17a5\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1751"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"到了蝉鸣的喧嚣渐渐平静下来的时节。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-178a\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-17e0\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-178a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我仍然待在医院之中。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-17b5\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1811\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-17b5"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当然了，我也不是一直都住在医院里。\n只是不停地重复着入院与出院的过程。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1821\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1881\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1821"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"上个月，我平生第一次尝到了手术的味道。\n出院后，还需要频繁地前往离家５分钟路程的医院，去接受定期检查。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-18ad\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-18f9\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-18ad"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"之后，便是住院、出院、检查、住院的循环…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-18ec\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1948\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-18ec"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"尽管不知道『ＰＥＴ』啊、『易瑞沙』啊…都是些什么东西，\n但不知不觉间，这单调的循环已经持续了几个月。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1976\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-19c6\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1976"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"食欲越来越差，服用药物的量与种类倒是与日俱增。\n我也终于深刻地体会到，自己的体力正在不断减弱。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-19fa\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1a50\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-19fa"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我发觉双腿越来越消瘦，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1a27\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1a83\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a27"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"体重计的指针告诉我，\n「这并不是错觉」。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1a75\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1ae3\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a75"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但是…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1a88\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1afc\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1a88"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我却冷漠地旁观着自己。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1ab5\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1b31\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1ab5"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"仿佛这是别人的事情似的，\n仿佛正在看着电视画面似的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1b0f\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1b93\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1b0f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"面对突如其来的现实，我还没有机会去思考太多。\n我无法对发生在自己身上的事情产生任何的切实感。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1b91\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1c15\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1b91"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"所以，尽管是自身的事情，\n但我却以旁人的眼光注视着它。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1c34\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1cd4\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c34"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"隆冬时节。\n当街头巷尾的圣诞气氛终于消散殆尽的时候，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1c8e\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1d2a\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1c8e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"或许是在新年之前不想留下晦气吧，医生们打发我回家了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1cd9\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1d6f\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1cd9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当然，回家只是暂时性的。\n但即便如此，我还是感到了一丝欣慰。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1d6b\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1dff\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1d6b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"冒着夹杂了冰滴的雨水，\n我回到了久违的家中。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1dbd\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1e59\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1dbd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"出乎我的意料，亲人们全都聚集在家里。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1df8\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1e8e\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1df8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"平时很少和我交谈的父母，\n摆出一副慈祥的表情迎接了我。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1e54\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1f14\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1e54"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"平日里没和我少拌嘴的妹妹，\n也做好了我最爱吃的奶油炖菜和炸虾排。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1eba\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1f96\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1eba"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"大家一起围坐在暖桌旁，抢着为我剥桔子皮。\n他们留给我的唯一印象，是那异乎寻常的亲切。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1f34\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2010\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f34"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这时…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1f47\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2029\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f47"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我隐约察觉到了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-1f6e\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2054\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1f6e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","basel