/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2309\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2486\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2309"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"所以，我只是简短地回答了一句。也没能想到其他可以说的话。\n直到走出客厅为止，我只说出了这一句话。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-238f\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2518\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-238f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"听到我的回答，\n医生拿起圆珠笔开始写着什么。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-23e1\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2574\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-23e1"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"大概是转入疗养院的手续吧。\n他仅仅是在完成自己的工作而已，父亲的态度也与他相仿。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2457\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-25fa\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2457"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…人的死，原来这么简单啊…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-2488\",\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/scenario.arc.unpacked/nar1_00\\\",\\\"main\\\"]/mjo-262b\"]","target":{"variantId":"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.unpacked/nar1_00","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2488"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这是我发自内心的感想。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"[\\\"mjo/narcissu3/update.arc.u